> Forward the application port

root@escbash-lab:~/student# curl -I http://10.96.174.229:80
kubectl -n student-devops port-forward \
  --address 0.0.0.0 \
  svc/student-app 8080:80
  
  Port	Location
8080	escbash host
80	    Kubernetes Service
8080	Application container

--address 0.0.0.0 allows the escbash preview to reach the forwarding process; the default is localhost only

